{"step_index":249,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-19T06:23:37Z","content":"I see the bug. Line 246: `tce-load -i /tmp/tce/optional/$pkg` — but TinyCore's `tce-load -i` needs paths relative to `$TCEDIR/optional`, not full paths. The fix: use `tce-load -i $pkg` after setting `TCEDIR` correctly AND mount squashfs directly as a fallback. Let me also fix the `ln -sf` collision issue.","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Fix squashfs-based TCZ loading: mount each .tcz directly and extract into rootfs, avoiding tce-load path issues. Also use xinit with explicit Xorg binary path.\"","EndLine":"283","Instruction":"\"Fix bootsync.sh to properly mount tcz squashfs files directly and use xinit/Xorg directly instead of startx\"","ReplacementContent":"\"bootsync_sh = \\\"\\\"\\\"#!/bin/sh\\n# Endroid OS Bare-Metal Bootsync\\n\\necho \\\"========================================================\\\"\\necho \\\"  Starting Endroid OS Standalone Bare-Metal Runtime\\\"\\necho \\\"========================================================\\\"\\n\\nmkdir -p /lib64\\nln -sf /lib/* /lib64/ 2>/dev/null || true\\nmdev -s 2>/dev/null || true\\n\\nifconfig lo 127.0.0.1 up\\nfor iface in $(ls /sys/class/net/ 2>/dev/null); do\\n    [ \\\"$iface\\\" = \\\"lo\\\" ] && continue\\n    ifconfig \\\"$iface\\\" up 2>/dev/null || true\\n    udhcpc -b -i \\\"$iface\\\" 2>/dev/null || true\\ndone\\n\\n# Setup TCEDIR\\nmkdir -p /tmp/tce/optional /etc/sysconfig\\nrm -f /etc/sysconfig/tcedir\\nln -s /tmp/tce /etc/sysconfig/tcedir\\necho Xorg > /etc/sysconfig/Xserver\\necho jwm > /etc/sysconfig/desktop\\n\\n# Copy embedded packages\\n[ -d /opt/tce/optional ] && cp /opt/tce/optional/*.tcz /tmp/tce/optional/ 2>/dev/null || true\\n\\n# Mount CD-ROM and copy packages\\nmkdir -p /mnt/sr0\\nfor dev in /dev/sr0 /dev/sr1 /dev/cdrom /dev/hdc; do\\n    mount -r $dev /mnt/sr0 2>/dev/null && break\\ndone\\nfor d in /mnt/sr0/cce/optional /mnt/sr0/tce/optional; do\\n    [ -d \\\"$d\\\" ] && cp \\\"$d\\\"/*.tcz /tmp/tce/optional/ 2>/dev/null || true\\ndone\\n\\n# Mount all .tcz squashfs packages directly into filesystem\\nmkdir -p /usr/local/tce.installed\\nfor pkg in /tmp/tce/optional/*.tcz; do\\n    [ -f \\\"$pkg\\\" ] || continue\\n    name=$(basename \\\"$pkg\\\" .tcz)\\n    mnt=\\\"/usr/local/tce.installed/$name\\\"\\n    mkdir -p \\\"$mnt\\\"\\n    mount -t squashfs -o loop,ro \\\"$pkg\\\" \\\"$mnt\\\" 2>/dev/null || continue\\n    # Overlay into root filesystem\\n    (cd \\\"$mnt\\\" && find . -not -type d | cpio -p --quiet / 2>/dev/null) || true\\ndone\\nldconfig 2>/dev/null || true\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nadd_text('opt/bootsync.sh', bootsync_sh, 0o100755)\\n\\nbootlocal_sh = \\\"\\\"\\\"#!/bin/sh\\n# Endroid OS bootlocal\\n\\nmkdir -p /lib64\\nln -sf /lib/* /lib64/ 2>/dev/null || true\\nldconfig 2>/dev/null || true\\n\\n# Start Node.js server\\nexport PORT=8080\\n/usr/local/bin/node /opt/endroid/server/index.js > /var/log/endroid.log 2>&1 &\\n\\n# \n<truncated 522 bytes>","StartLine":"200","TargetContent":"\"bootsync_sh = \\\"\\\"\\\"#!/bin/sh\\n# Endroid OS Bare-Metal Bootsync — Runs at physical boot as root\\n\\necho \\\"========================================================\\\"\\necho \\\"  Starting Endroid OS Standalone Bare-Metal Runtime\\\"\\necho \\\"========================================================\\\"\\n\\n# 1. Critical library symlinks for 64-bit glibc binaries (Node.js, Xorg)\\nmkdir -p /lib64\\nln -sf /lib/* /lib64/ 2>/dev/null || true\\n\\n# 2. Hardware device discovery\\nmdev -s 2>/dev/null || true\\n\\n# 3. Network auto-configuration (DHCP loopback + all Ethernet/Wi-Fi)\\nifconfig lo 127.0.0.1 up\\nfor iface in $(ls /sys/class/net/ 2>/dev/null); do\\n    if [ \\\"$iface\\\" != \\\"lo\\\" ]; then\\n        ifconfig \\\"$iface\\\" up 2>/dev/null || true\\n        udhcpc -b -i \\\"$iface\\\" -s /usr/share/udhcpc/default.script 2>/dev/null || true\\n    fi\\ndo